translate turkish loveinterestmontage_431a3ecb:

    # sc "If we had more time, I'd love to hear more, but the school year is about to end and I'll be leaving."
    sc "Daha fazla vaktimiz olsaydı, daha fazlasını dinlemek isterdim, ama okul yılı bitmek üzere ve ben de ayrılacağım."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:209
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_78da187b:

    # sc "I think you might need to see a professional therapist."
    sc "Bence profesyonel bir terapiste görünmen gerekebilir."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:212
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_65853ce4:

    # pc "Are they all like you?"
    pc "Hepsi senin gibi mi?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:213
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_0316ba54:

    # sc "Not even close, baby."
    sc "Hiç de değil, canım."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:217
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_b38363c8:

    # wt "I'm glad that I was able to get through to that world's version of me and she could help you."
    wt "O dünyadaki versiyonuma ulaşabildiğim ve onun sana yardım edebilmesine sevindim."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:218
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_af0f850c:

    # pc "Me too. How did you do that?"
    pc "Ben de. Bunu nasıl başardın?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:219
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_f5af9ece:

    # wt "I built a device that could send messages between worlds."
    wt "Dünyalar arasında mesaj gönderebilen bir cihaz yaptım."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:220
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_b6a5943b:

    # pc "Just while I was gone? That was quick."
    pc "Ben yokken mi? Çok çabuk olmuş."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:221
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_c5e0562a:

    # wt "I was motivated."
    wt "Motivasyonum vardı."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:224
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_ccb1fefb:

    # pc "So, I could talk to my dad? Or anyone else that I met there?"
    pc "Yani babamla konuşabilir miyim? Ya da orada tanıştığım başka biriyle?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:225
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_85724e3f:

    # wt "Theoretically. They don't have any way to speak back though. Yet."
    wt "Teorik olarak. Ama onlar cevap vermenin bir yolu yok. Henüz."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:226
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_b0652138:

    # wt "Is that something that you'd want to do?"
    wt "Bu, yapmak isteyeceğin bir şey mi?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:227
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_5b22d737:

    # pc "Maybe."
    pc "Belki."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:230
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_b67e5d2c:

    # wt "I'm not sure why you lost so much time during the return trip."
    wt "Dönüş yolculuğunda neden bu kadar çok zaman kaybettiğini anlamadım."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:231
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_4a7e2d03:

    # wt "It seems like time moves faster over there, so less time should have passed here."
    wt "Orada zaman daha hızlı akıyor gibi görünüyor, bu yüzden burada daha az zaman geçmiş olmalıydı."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:232
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_f52c90f3:

    # wt "But you had that beard when you came back and a month passed while you were gone."
    wt "Ama geri döndüğünde sakalın vardı ve sen yokken bir ay geçmişti."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:235
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_522730c7:

    # wt "More studies will have to be done."
    wt "Daha fazla araştırma yapılması gerekecek."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:236
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_7dc54a4b:

    # wt "Can I count on you to help me with them? I'd love to hire you, now that you're almost done with school."
    wt "Bu araştırmalarda bana yardım edeceğine güvenebilir miyim? Okulu neredeyse bitirdiğine göre seni işe almak isterim."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:237
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_39c52a0e:

    # wt "I believe graduation is this weekend?"
    wt "Mezuniyet bu hafta sonu değil mi?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:240
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_38559d3f:

    # pc "Graduation!"
    pc "Mezuniyet!"

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:241
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_ac2fc58a:

    # pc "Fuck..."
    pc "Kahretsin..."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:245
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_05caf076:

    # et "You missed some assignments and the final..."
    et "Bazı ödevleri ve final sınavını kaçırdın..."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:247
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_b3be8a82:

    # et "... but don't worry, honey, I took care of it for you."
    et "... ama merak etme tatlım, senin için hallettim."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:248
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_399bdc0f:

    # pc "Really?"
    pc "Gerçekten mi?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:251
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_962b180d:

    # et "Of course. You're a smart boy. I know you would have done well on them."
    et "Tabii ki. Sen akıllı bir çocuksun. Onlarda başarılı olacağını biliyorum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:252
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_486294f6:

    # et "I'm not going to stop you from graduating because you had something more important going on in your life for a while."
    et "Bir süre hayatında daha önemli şeyler olduğu için mezun olmanı engellemeyeceğim."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:255
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_08a658e1:

    # et "Besides... I take care of you and I know you'll take care of me later."
    et "Ayrıca... Ben sana göz kulak oluyorum ve sen de daha sonra bana göz kulak olacağını biliyorum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:256
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_e4d26afc:

    # et "Right?"
    et "Değil mi?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:257
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_78bd7358:

    # pc "Damn right."
    pc "Kesinlikle öyle."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:259
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_dd7b6f24:

    # et "... but if you sit and take the final real quick and you pass, you'll still be able to graduate."
    et "... ama oturup final sınavına çabucak girip geçersen, yine de mezun olabilirsin."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:260
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_e9e45599:

    # pc "Oh yes please, Mrs. McGee. That would be great."
    pc "Oh evet lütfen, Bayan McGee. Bu harika olur."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:266
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_d0ae05fb:

    # et "This is very good. You'll pass."
    et "Bu çok iyi. Geçeceksin."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:267
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_b6c4c749:

    # et "I knew you were a smart boy."
    et "Akıllı bir çocuk olduğunu biliyordum."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:268
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_6f49be4e:

    # pc "Thanks so much, Mrs. McGee."
    pc "Çok teşekkürler, Bayan McGee."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:272
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_d08e2cf8:

    # sst "Yeah, you missed a few things..."
    sst "Evet, birkaç şeyi kaçırdın..."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:274
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_322a44f2:

    # sst "...but I'm not going to fail you."
    sst "...ama seni bırakmayacağım."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:277
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_97e19796:

    # sst "I need you to graduate so that I feel less guilty about fucking you every chance I get."
    sst "Her fırsatta seninle sevişirken kendimi daha az suçlu hissetmek için mezun olmana ihtiyacım var."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:278
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_dc418b49:

    # pc "Really? So I'm good?"
    pc "Gerçekten mi? Yani durumum iyi mi?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:281
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_8e879040:

    # sst "You might have to do some private studies... but yeah, you're so good, baby."
    sst "Biraz özel ders alman gerekebilir... ama evet, çok iyisin bebeğim."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:283
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_cc1fc6d9:

    # sst "... but I hate failing people, especially when I can tell that they're trying."
    sst "...ama insanları başarısız saymaktan nefret ederim, özellikle de çaba gösterdiklerini görebildiğimde."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:284
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_d70fddc8:

    # sst "So you're good. You'll pass."
    sst "Yani durumun iyi. Geçeceksin."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:285
translate turkish loveinterestmontage_3484a643:

    # pc "Thanks so much, Ms. Welch."
    pc "Çok teşekkürler Bayan Welch."

